WEBVTT

01:30.810 --> 01:34.979
[Legend of the Magnate]

01:35.030 --> 01:37.930
[Episode 37]

01:39.350 --> 01:40.950
I thought to myself back then

01:42.479 --> 01:46.390
even if it meant falling into hell
and never getting out,

01:48.680 --> 01:50.640
I couldn't stay poor.

02:57.190 --> 02:57.680
Father!

03:08.400 --> 03:09.520
You told me...

03:12.750 --> 03:14.910
your mother has forgiven me.

03:17.800 --> 03:18.660
What about you?

03:20.960 --> 03:22.079
I pity you.

03:45.430 --> 03:46.000
Father.

03:46.430 --> 03:46.960
Father.

03:48.710 --> 03:49.280
Father.

03:54.120 --> 03:56.120
If you don't want to stay here,

03:57.590 --> 03:59.390
you can go down the mountain too.

04:00.560 --> 04:01.160
Father...

04:04.030 --> 04:06.090
Let's go down the mountain together.

04:06.590 --> 04:08.920
You don't need to care about these things.

04:10.960 --> 04:11.590
Father.

04:12.310 --> 04:13.000
Look.

04:15.870 --> 04:16.680
You and I—

04:16.720 --> 04:18.190
aren't we doing just fine?

04:20.040 --> 04:21.630
That bastard Gu

04:21.750 --> 04:22.720
and that crazy woman—

04:22.720 --> 04:24.420
we don't even know them.

04:26.510 --> 04:27.630
He's just

04:27.630 --> 04:29.490
an exile from Ningguta,

04:30.240 --> 04:32.150
a dirt‑poor tea farmer.

04:33.630 --> 04:35.480
But you're Li Million.

04:37.630 --> 04:38.510
You are...

04:40.480 --> 04:41.070
Father.

04:44.600 --> 04:47.159
You're the wealthiest man

04:47.800 --> 04:49.659
in the capital's business world,

04:50.360 --> 04:52.060
a businessman with a red official's hat

04:52.060 --> 04:54.120
who is trusted by the imperial court.

04:54.159 --> 04:54.750
Father.

04:56.830 --> 04:58.950
Forget all of this.

05:01.600 --> 05:03.680
Just be my father, and mine alone.

05:06.270 --> 05:07.390
Alright, Father?

05:09.920 --> 05:11.450
Let's go down the mountain.

05:21.800 --> 05:24.400
A mistake this big
is too much to make even once,

05:24.680 --> 05:26.240
let alone twice.

05:30.560 --> 05:31.310
Now do you see

05:31.310 --> 05:33.000
why I didn't let you

05:34.040 --> 05:35.630
associate with that Gu?

05:39.920 --> 05:40.800
Child,

05:42.510 --> 05:44.070
you truly are clever,

05:45.070 --> 05:46.600
but far too competitive.

05:49.920 --> 05:51.780
The family wealth I'm leaving you

05:54.600 --> 05:57.200
is enough for you
to live a lifetime in comfort.

05:57.560 --> 05:58.890
Don't go into business.

05:59.920 --> 06:01.120
Go back to the capital

06:01.630 --> 06:03.690
and do whatever you want except that.

06:07.800 --> 06:08.400
Father...

06:11.750 --> 06:14.160
You want me to go back alone?

06:30.800 --> 06:32.270
I don't have the strength

06:32.270 --> 06:33.800
to step out this door.

06:36.510 --> 06:37.630
Coming here

06:38.630 --> 06:39.720
at this time

06:41.040 --> 06:42.310
was heaven's will.

06:46.630 --> 06:48.159
I will die here,

06:49.159 --> 06:50.690
live through 10 lifetimes,

06:52.430 --> 06:54.480
and end up becoming the lowest dust.

06:56.070 --> 07:05.520
[Composure and Equanimity]

06:58.600 --> 06:59.460
Repay my debts,

07:00.870 --> 07:01.600
make amends,

07:03.360 --> 07:04.190
and atone.

07:49.040 --> 07:52.040
The person who set me up
in the imperial examination back then

07:52.040 --> 07:53.120
was you.

07:56.040 --> 07:57.700
I knew you came to the capital.

07:59.600 --> 08:01.930
I was afraid
if you really passed the exam,

08:03.000 --> 08:04.720
the show couldn't go on.

08:20.310 --> 08:21.270
You just think I can't

08:21.270 --> 08:22.800
compete with Gu Pingyuan.

08:24.000 --> 08:25.260
You underestimate me.

08:26.430 --> 08:27.830
Let me make a bet with you.

08:28.480 --> 08:30.160
I'll compete with him fairly

08:30.190 --> 08:31.270
in business.

08:32.429 --> 08:34.510
When I crush him

08:34.620 --> 08:35.480
and make his entire family

08:35.480 --> 08:36.630
disappear,

08:39.120 --> 08:40.450
I'll come to pick you up.

09:44.140 --> 09:48.710
[Li's Draft Bank, Nanjing]

09:57.240 --> 09:57.790
Sir.

09:58.270 --> 10:00.270
I want to make a deal with you.

10:00.670 --> 10:02.130
I'm just a small merchant.

10:02.550 --> 10:04.240
How dare I do business with you?

10:04.240 --> 10:05.510
You must be joking.

10:10.660 --> 10:12.820
Am I joking with you,

10:12.910 --> 10:14.910
or are you joking with me?

10:20.150 --> 10:21.240
I heard your father

10:23.120 --> 10:25.480
became a monk
and is now living in seclusion.

10:25.480 --> 10:26.750
You're in charge now.

10:27.120 --> 10:27.980
How about this?

10:28.200 --> 10:29.360
However much your family

10:29.360 --> 10:30.840
spent on the salt fields,

10:31.150 --> 10:33.210
Liangjiang will pay you back in full.

10:33.300 --> 10:34.560
Go back to the capital.

10:38.840 --> 10:39.360
Sir.

10:40.720 --> 10:42.720
You were the one who invited us here.

10:43.240 --> 10:44.100
This draft bank

10:44.150 --> 10:46.110
was also opened at your request.

10:46.480 --> 10:48.240
The Li family invested so much money

10:48.240 --> 10:49.550
in Liangjiang region.

10:49.670 --> 10:51.120
Do you expect us

10:51.750 --> 10:54.280
to just obediently go back
because you say so?

10:56.080 --> 10:57.480
The Li family's business

10:57.630 --> 10:59.240
doesn't belong solely to us.

11:00.030 --> 11:01.440
If you want to get your hands on it,

11:01.440 --> 11:03.770
you should first ask the others involved.

11:06.670 --> 11:09.130
Stop trying to intimidate me
with big names.

11:09.510 --> 11:10.080
Indeed.

11:10.510 --> 11:11.630
I know your Li family

11:11.630 --> 11:13.600
has the Sixth Prince's capital behind it.

11:13.600 --> 11:16.000
But when it comes to the livelihood
of Liangjiang region

11:16.000 --> 11:17.390
and the imperial court's tax revenue,

11:17.390 --> 11:19.120
even if His Highness were here,

11:19.200 --> 11:20.910
I doubt he could protect you.

11:22.840 --> 11:24.440
Let me remind you of something:

11:24.440 --> 11:26.300
the one I invited was your father,

11:26.550 --> 11:28.510
not you, a little nobody.

11:29.000 --> 11:30.820
Everyone abandons a sinking ship.

11:30.820 --> 11:32.020
Without your father,

11:32.110 --> 11:34.320
do you think
the Sixth Prince will still shield you?

11:34.320 --> 11:36.480
As for the business in Liangjiang,

11:36.670 --> 11:39.030
it has nothing to do with your Li family.

11:40.720 --> 11:43.080
Since your father has retired,

11:44.000 --> 11:45.260
you should go back now.

11:46.240 --> 11:46.840
By the way,

11:47.360 --> 11:48.280
This
Complete Library of the Four Treasuries

11:48.280 --> 11:49.200
is for you.

11:49.510 --> 11:52.340
After you go back, read it,
and learn some sense.

11:52.630 --> 11:53.320
Come back

11:53.320 --> 11:54.720
only when you've learned

11:54.790 --> 11:55.990
how to be a proper man.

11:59.440 --> 12:01.000
Do you understand?

12:02.510 --> 12:03.120
Sir.

12:04.030 --> 12:05.200
According to what you said,

12:05.200 --> 12:07.130
our previous bet no longer counts?

12:08.150 --> 12:10.320
You really thought you would win?

12:10.390 --> 12:12.150
Why don't you take a look at the accounts?

12:12.150 --> 12:12.840
That's only because

12:12.840 --> 12:14.150
the Liangjiang Viceroy's Office

12:14.150 --> 12:15.790
has been backing Gu Pingyuan.

12:15.790 --> 12:17.480
The Salt Monopoly
and Distribution Franchise System

12:17.480 --> 12:19.360
is an outdated system now.

12:19.630 --> 12:20.870
It's pointless to still talk about

12:20.870 --> 12:22.280
illegal salt these days.

12:22.360 --> 12:23.910
It doesn't matter if you don't accept it.

12:23.910 --> 12:26.070
The date of our wager is almost here.

12:26.200 --> 12:27.290
If you lose,

12:27.390 --> 12:28.720
just hurry up and leave.

12:29.600 --> 12:31.630
Don't forget to leave the shares to me.

12:31.630 --> 12:33.430
Don't embarrass yourself here.

12:37.510 --> 12:39.440
His Excellency is returning home!

12:42.810 --> 12:46.070
[Salt Industry Guild]

12:43.390 --> 12:44.150
This Li Qin

12:44.550 --> 12:46.360
is getting more and more outrageous.

12:46.360 --> 12:47.420
He even sent people

12:47.550 --> 12:49.200
to my salt store to poach workers.

12:49.200 --> 12:50.630
And he's already taken away

12:50.630 --> 12:52.000
a few well-trained hands.

12:52.000 --> 12:53.340
They say he offered them

12:53.480 --> 12:54.380
double the pay.

12:54.410 --> 12:55.560
Who does business

12:55.750 --> 12:56.870
like that?

12:56.960 --> 12:57.600
Exactly!

12:58.080 --> 12:58.720
Exactly!

12:58.720 --> 12:59.270
Yes.

13:00.000 --> 13:00.960
All my staff have left.

13:00.960 --> 13:01.870
Mr. Tu,

13:02.360 --> 13:04.420
which are the largest
salt-producing regions

13:04.420 --> 13:05.750
in our country right now?

13:05.750 --> 13:07.790
There are 5 major

13:07.840 --> 13:09.300
salt-producing regions.

13:09.490 --> 13:10.820
The Changlu Salt Region

13:11.030 --> 13:11.890
covers Leting,

13:12.270 --> 13:12.930
Tanghai,

13:13.150 --> 13:14.810
Tanggu, and nearby counties.

13:15.360 --> 13:16.630
The Fengtian Salt Region

13:16.630 --> 13:18.900
is the largest salt-producing area
beyond the pass,

13:18.900 --> 13:20.960
though transportation there
isn't very convenient.

13:20.960 --> 13:21.690
Then there's

13:21.790 --> 13:23.320
the Laizhou Bay Salt Region

13:23.390 --> 13:24.850
along the Shandong coast,

13:24.960 --> 13:25.810
which was once

13:25.960 --> 13:27.200
the fief of Jiang Ziya

13:27.510 --> 13:28.390
and later

13:28.480 --> 13:30.120
the territory of the Kingdom of Qi

13:30.120 --> 13:31.810
after the fall of the Shang dynasty.

13:31.810 --> 13:32.630
There's also

13:33.000 --> 13:34.530
our Lianghuai Salt Region,

13:34.550 --> 13:36.270
and finally the well salt region

13:36.270 --> 13:37.400
in Fushun, Sichuan.

13:37.580 --> 13:38.150
The salt we sell

13:38.150 --> 13:39.390
in our store today

13:39.630 --> 13:40.600
is a mix

13:40.630 --> 13:42.550
of Lianghuai salt and well salt.

13:43.120 --> 13:44.510
In terms of taste,

13:44.840 --> 13:45.740
well salt

13:46.240 --> 13:47.750
is slightly superior.

13:50.120 --> 13:51.740
Actually, I have some

13:52.000 --> 13:53.360
rough ideas

13:53.720 --> 13:55.780
and would like to hear your thoughts.

13:56.910 --> 13:58.040
I've been thinking,

13:58.390 --> 13:59.520
people consume salt

13:59.750 --> 14:01.480
in limited quantities, right?

14:02.030 --> 14:03.320
You can't possibly eat salt

14:03.320 --> 14:05.120
as your main food for every meal.

14:05.270 --> 14:06.240
We already have enough

14:06.240 --> 14:07.200
salt shops now.

14:07.550 --> 14:08.680
Opening another one

14:08.960 --> 14:09.690
would at most

14:10.020 --> 14:12.480
take a bigger slice
of the market's profits.

14:12.630 --> 14:14.390
It's not a wise move

14:14.720 --> 14:15.850
and not worth doing.

14:16.030 --> 14:16.960
The problem is Li

14:16.960 --> 14:18.550
has already come knocking.

14:18.630 --> 14:19.920
With his abundant capital,

14:19.920 --> 14:20.870
if we open one new shop,

14:20.870 --> 14:22.270
he can open two next door.

14:22.400 --> 14:23.400
What should we do?

14:23.790 --> 14:24.450
Do we have to

14:24.600 --> 14:25.930
lower our prices again?

14:26.000 --> 14:27.120
-Yeah.
-We can't do that.

14:27.120 --> 14:28.120
A price war

14:28.200 --> 14:29.790
is just a desperate measure.

14:29.790 --> 14:30.720
If we continue this war like this,

14:30.720 --> 14:32.980
everyone will end up losing everything.

14:33.080 --> 14:34.610
That's no longer business.

14:34.750 --> 14:36.210
It's just being stubborn.

14:37.150 --> 14:37.790
Besides,

14:38.450 --> 14:40.250
I can't keep this up much longer.

14:40.620 --> 14:43.710
[Tranquility of Autumn]

14:47.630 --> 14:48.490
It got stained.

14:48.840 --> 14:50.000
It's okay, Mother.

14:50.080 --> 14:52.140
I'll have your son buy me another one.

14:59.030 --> 14:59.480
Yu'er.

15:00.310 --> 15:00.870
Let me.

15:09.150 --> 15:11.010
Mother still refuses to drink it.

15:18.840 --> 15:19.480
Mother,

15:20.480 --> 15:21.750
I had someone bring

15:21.840 --> 15:23.480
goose‑fat cakes for you from Jiangning.

15:23.480 --> 15:24.910
Take your medicine first,

15:24.910 --> 15:26.550
and then you can have the cakes.

15:26.550 --> 15:28.150
I'm not a child.

15:29.270 --> 15:30.720
Why bother coaxing me?

15:33.730 --> 15:35.460
If something is bothering you,

15:36.000 --> 15:36.910
just tell me.

15:37.750 --> 15:38.550
But you must

15:38.720 --> 15:39.780
take the medicine.

15:41.600 --> 15:42.270
Pingyuan,

15:43.360 --> 15:44.510
help me up.

15:44.870 --> 15:46.070
Let me sit for a while.

16:05.720 --> 16:07.550
Why do you look so pale?

16:12.150 --> 16:13.240
Are you stunned?

16:16.070 --> 16:18.200
There's been too much going on lately.

16:19.960 --> 16:21.090
Pingwen scolded me,

16:21.620 --> 16:22.320
saying I never should have

16:22.320 --> 16:23.720
taken you away from home,

16:24.160 --> 16:26.240
and that I've only harmed you
by doing this.

16:26.240 --> 16:27.750
I think he had a point.

16:29.290 --> 16:30.240
If I hadn't insisted
on going to the capital

16:30.240 --> 16:32.470
for the imperial examination back then,

16:32.470 --> 16:34.330
none of this would have happened.

16:35.600 --> 16:37.120
Were you ever in control?

16:38.550 --> 16:39.720
There's no immortal

16:39.740 --> 16:40.980
who tells us

16:41.200 --> 16:42.660
what we're supposed to do.

16:45.550 --> 16:46.320
If I had known

16:46.320 --> 16:47.840
he would never return,

16:48.790 --> 16:50.480
I wouldn't have let him go.

16:50.510 --> 16:52.710
Wouldn't that have solved everything?

16:53.200 --> 16:54.200
But what's the point

16:54.200 --> 16:55.440
of saying this now?

16:57.790 --> 16:58.910
It's all fate.

17:01.080 --> 17:03.080
Even if fate really exists,

17:04.310 --> 17:05.640
I'm going to fight it.

17:07.510 --> 17:08.200
Mother,

17:09.680 --> 17:11.109
you must stay well.

17:11.829 --> 17:13.589
One day you'll have

17:14.240 --> 17:15.170
grandchildren.

17:15.589 --> 17:18.050
You still have
a long, long life ahead of you.

17:18.829 --> 17:20.069
You can't just let go.

17:27.310 --> 17:28.510
Be honest with me.

17:29.790 --> 17:30.830
Do you want

17:33.030 --> 17:34.400
that man to come back

17:35.270 --> 17:35.920
to see you?

17:38.240 --> 17:38.960
If you do,

17:38.960 --> 17:40.560
no matter how I feel about it,

17:40.880 --> 17:41.830
I can go beg him—

17:42.960 --> 17:44.470
I can go kneel to him

17:45.070 --> 17:46.070
and kowtow to him—

17:46.270 --> 17:47.550
as long as it makes you happy,

17:47.550 --> 17:48.550
I'll do anything.

17:50.880 --> 17:52.540
What would I want him back for?

17:56.880 --> 17:58.690
All my life,

17:58.750 --> 17:59.350
I've been holding on

17:59.350 --> 18:01.550
to this one thing—

18:03.270 --> 18:06.140
I never knew if he was dead or alive,

18:06.240 --> 18:08.090
where he died,

18:08.550 --> 18:09.350
and whether his remains

18:09.350 --> 18:10.920
were left out

18:11.070 --> 18:12.350
in the wind and rain.

18:14.640 --> 18:16.110
But as you've seen,

18:16.550 --> 18:18.030
he's living just fine,

18:18.310 --> 18:19.770
even changed his surname.

18:21.350 --> 18:22.480
Isn't that

18:22.480 --> 18:24.510
the biggest joke on me?

18:26.200 --> 18:26.920
Pingyuan,

18:30.160 --> 18:32.560
now that I've finally
let go of this burden,

18:34.110 --> 18:36.480
I feel empty inside.

18:39.030 --> 18:40.480
No medicine can fix that.

18:41.960 --> 18:44.200
Just let me be.

18:46.920 --> 18:47.400
No.

18:48.920 --> 18:50.320
You can't think that way.

18:51.240 --> 18:52.700
That man changed his name,

18:53.550 --> 18:55.010
and his heart changed too.

18:56.160 --> 18:58.090
The person you've been waiting for

18:58.290 --> 18:59.350
died on his way

18:59.350 --> 19:00.790
to the imperial examination.

19:00.790 --> 19:02.070
He is a dead man now.

19:02.110 --> 19:03.680
But we are still alive.

19:05.000 --> 19:06.200
We can't let a dead man

19:06.200 --> 19:07.310
trample over us,

19:08.550 --> 19:09.160
can we?

19:34.270 --> 19:34.880
Pingwen.

19:53.000 --> 19:54.860
Why do you have to be angry with me?

19:57.920 --> 19:58.590
Take good care of Mother

19:58.590 --> 19:59.720
these next few days.

20:00.310 --> 20:01.370
I'm going on a trip.

20:07.310 --> 20:08.440
Where are you going?

20:09.160 --> 20:10.760
I'm going to Jinshan Temple.

20:11.350 --> 20:13.010
Are you going to bring him back

20:14.350 --> 20:16.280
or acknowledge him as your father?

20:18.160 --> 20:19.200
It's too late.

20:20.350 --> 20:21.510
He has a son now.

20:22.960 --> 20:23.750
And you, Gu Pingyuan,

20:23.750 --> 20:25.000
are nothing to him.

20:53.440 --> 20:55.770
You think hiding away solves everything?

21:02.400 --> 21:04.440
I've seen enough of the past,

21:07.550 --> 21:09.750
and I don't want to look at what's ahead.

21:48.670 --> 21:49.440
Kid...

21:49.550 --> 21:50.550
Don't call me kid!

21:56.590 --> 21:58.250
Your kid is down the mountain.

22:12.280 --> 22:14.540
Seeing how devoted you are to your mother

22:16.750 --> 22:18.310
makes me feel gratified.

22:21.630 --> 22:22.790
When I saw her that day,

22:22.790 --> 22:23.960
I knew

22:26.660 --> 22:28.260
the dream had to end.

22:29.750 --> 22:31.830
I couldn't keep pretending anymore.

22:32.110 --> 22:33.440
What do you mean by that?

22:34.270 --> 22:36.120
You don't want to deal with anything
anymore?

22:36.120 --> 22:37.700
I won't hold it against you

22:38.680 --> 22:40.280
how you wronged me back then.

22:41.110 --> 22:43.710
But now my mother's life
is hanging by a thread,

22:43.880 --> 22:45.940
and she won't even take her medicine.

22:46.510 --> 22:47.160
As her son,

22:47.160 --> 22:48.960
I don't know how to persuade her.

22:50.350 --> 22:50.960
I just hope

22:50.960 --> 22:51.920
you can go see her

22:53.160 --> 22:54.820
and say something, anything,

22:55.640 --> 22:56.990
to ease her heart

22:58.310 --> 22:59.570
so she can keep living.

23:08.720 --> 23:10.120
What did your mother say?

23:10.880 --> 23:13.140
She said now that she's finally seen you,

23:14.000 --> 23:15.600
her wish has been fulfilled,

23:18.720 --> 23:20.580
and she doesn't have the strength

23:21.880 --> 23:22.880
to hold on.

23:35.720 --> 23:37.110
What should I say to her?

23:39.480 --> 23:40.590
How should I say it?

23:42.160 --> 23:42.880
Indeed.

23:45.720 --> 23:47.000
It seem

23:48.070 --> 23:49.590
you've never regretted

23:49.590 --> 23:50.850
a single thing you did.

23:53.640 --> 23:55.110
You really are shameless.

23:57.480 --> 23:58.570
I told my mother,

23:59.920 --> 24:02.180
"You don't need to wait for him anymore."

24:02.550 --> 24:04.000
"He died long ago,"

24:06.200 --> 24:07.850
"on the road to the capital"

24:07.880 --> 24:09.740
"for the imperial examination."

24:11.550 --> 24:12.690
"That man is dead,"

24:13.830 --> 24:15.430
"and his heart has changed."

24:42.110 --> 24:43.070
Well said.

24:46.550 --> 24:47.400
Well said.

25:00.150 --> 25:01.000
Well said.

25:02.080 --> 25:04.730
[Tranquil Mind]

25:12.510 --> 25:13.770
Since that's the case,

25:15.030 --> 25:17.150
Master, I wish you a long life

25:18.640 --> 25:20.120
and an early ascent to paradise.

25:20.120 --> 25:23.900
[Tranquil Mind]

25:39.590 --> 25:40.510
Mr. Gu!

25:41.830 --> 25:42.880
Gu Tanyue!

25:44.720 --> 25:45.510
Sir!

25:59.880 --> 26:01.080
What happened to him?

26:01.240 --> 26:01.880
Suicide.

26:07.170 --> 26:08.150
How did he die?

26:08.630 --> 26:09.360
Poison.

26:09.590 --> 26:11.450
He carried his medicine with him.

26:13.250 --> 26:14.670
Did he ask you to call me?

26:15.350 --> 26:17.410
He said he wanted to give you closure.

26:18.880 --> 26:20.000
Amitabha.

30:04.830 --> 30:05.430
Pingyuan?

30:08.800 --> 30:10.130
Why are you back so late?

30:47.110 --> 30:47.590
Mother?

30:48.830 --> 30:50.360
Are you feeling better now?

30:55.400 --> 30:57.200
I dreamed about him last night.

30:59.350 --> 31:00.880
He was standing at the door,

31:08.680 --> 31:09.880
right there,

31:13.030 --> 31:14.240
just like the day

31:14.240 --> 31:15.350
he left,

31:16.720 --> 31:18.380
with his backpack on his back,

31:18.750 --> 31:20.000
his basket in hand,

31:21.350 --> 31:24.880
and inside were brush, ink, inkstone,

31:25.160 --> 31:27.110
and the rice balls I made for him.

31:30.720 --> 31:31.880
He said to me...

31:32.470 --> 31:33.270
He said,

31:33.960 --> 31:35.240
"I failed the exam."

31:36.720 --> 31:37.270
I told him,

31:37.270 --> 31:38.880
"So what?"

31:40.000 --> 31:42.350
"Our son has made something of himself."

31:43.200 --> 31:44.750
"Isn't that even happier news"

31:44.750 --> 31:46.400
"than you passing the exam?"

31:48.830 --> 31:50.070
He said he was tired

31:54.400 --> 31:56.400
and wanted to sleep a little,

32:00.070 --> 32:01.930
and that's when I knew he was dead.

32:04.720 --> 32:06.830
He regretted it after all.

32:09.480 --> 32:10.030
Yes.

32:11.830 --> 32:12.790
He regretted it.

32:14.720 --> 32:15.350
He said

32:16.400 --> 32:18.060
he really wanted to come back.

32:29.510 --> 32:32.070
So I didn't wait for nothing.

32:36.200 --> 32:37.920
There's so much temptation

32:39.480 --> 32:41.480
out there in the world.

32:44.790 --> 32:46.340
You took a wrong turn

32:46.440 --> 32:48.350
but still managed to come back—

32:48.480 --> 32:50.400
that's a blessing.

32:54.510 --> 32:55.640
How did he die?

32:57.070 --> 32:57.790
He...

33:00.680 --> 33:02.000
he just died,

33:03.310 --> 33:04.240
without pain.

33:04.720 --> 33:06.270
I know that, of course.

33:09.680 --> 33:10.940
What's wrong with you?

33:11.110 --> 33:11.680
I...

33:13.200 --> 33:15.480
I haven't been feeling well
these past few days.

33:15.480 --> 33:17.310
Yesterday I went to see the doctor.

33:17.310 --> 33:17.790
This morning,

33:17.790 --> 33:19.450
when I went to get my medicine,

33:19.680 --> 33:20.550
he told me...

33:27.350 --> 33:28.540
I'm pregnant.

33:41.540 --> 33:43.380
What are you doing? Are you stunned?

33:43.380 --> 33:43.920
Yu'er,

33:44.000 --> 33:45.800
go back to your room now and rest.

33:45.830 --> 33:47.860
When I recover,

33:48.200 --> 33:50.150
I'll help you take care of the baby.

33:50.310 --> 33:51.200
Mother is right.

33:51.200 --> 33:52.640
Come on, let me help you back.

33:52.640 --> 33:53.640
I don't need your help.

33:53.640 --> 33:54.780
I can walk on my own.

33:56.720 --> 33:58.120
What are you waiting for?

33:58.130 --> 33:58.480
Mother.

33:58.480 --> 33:59.720
Go and ask

33:59.830 --> 34:01.440
who examined her pulse.

34:03.590 --> 34:04.110
Well...

34:04.440 --> 34:04.880
You...

34:48.230 --> 34:48.840
Thank you.

34:48.860 --> 34:49.500
Take care.

34:48.880 --> 34:53.139
[Tongji Pharmacy]

34:53.670 --> 34:54.199
Pingwen!

35:30.110 --> 35:38.210
[Memorial]

36:12.580 --> 36:14.430
The host bows in return!

36:16.940 --> 36:19.660
[Memorial]

36:29.000 --> 36:29.780
Pingyuan?

36:30.590 --> 36:31.310
Pingyuan?

36:31.550 --> 36:32.380
Pingyuan,

36:32.510 --> 36:33.780
snap out of it.

36:33.960 --> 36:35.110
Yu'er has fainted from crying

36:35.110 --> 36:36.230
several times already.

36:36.230 --> 36:37.230
What if something happens

36:37.230 --> 36:38.230
to her child?

36:52.000 --> 36:53.110
Mother,

36:53.710 --> 36:56.190
wouldn't it be better
if we went back to Huizhou?

36:56.190 --> 36:57.710
The host bows in return!

36:58.460 --> 37:04.920
[Memorial]

36:59.440 --> 37:01.840
You haven't seen me get married yet.

37:02.760 --> 37:04.320
Mother...

37:27.710 --> 37:28.880
Why didn't I

37:28.900 --> 37:30.230
stay longer in her room?

37:42.000 --> 37:43.590
When Mother fell asleep,

37:45.860 --> 37:46.790
she was smiling.

37:48.800 --> 37:50.440
She passed away in her sleep.

37:52.190 --> 37:53.360
The elders say

37:55.190 --> 37:56.440
it was her time to go,

37:57.440 --> 37:58.970
and that she didn't suffer.

38:01.110 --> 38:04.710
That was the result of the blessings
she accumulated in her life.

38:05.230 --> 38:06.590
As her children,

38:07.760 --> 38:09.220
we should be happy for her.

38:16.070 --> 38:17.400
Ten years of wandering,

38:19.630 --> 38:21.030
ten years of struggle.

38:24.400 --> 38:26.730
We never had a chance
to truly care for her.

38:30.190 --> 38:31.320
I hate myself.

38:35.230 --> 38:37.360
Even if I had the strength of nine oxen,

38:39.960 --> 38:40.630
I couldn't

38:40.630 --> 38:42.560
pull her back from the underworld.

39:01.960 --> 39:04.290
She knew
she was going to be a grandmother.

39:06.880 --> 39:08.880
This child came at the perfect time,

39:10.960 --> 39:11.960
yet also too late.

39:23.840 --> 39:25.280
You two must stay well.

39:26.360 --> 39:27.090
Understand?

39:28.480 --> 39:30.080
I won't allow you to get sick.

39:31.030 --> 39:32.710
I won't allow any misfortune.

39:33.800 --> 39:35.000
Both you and the child

39:35.510 --> 39:36.480
must be safe.

39:54.840 --> 39:57.030
The host bows in return!

40:08.440 --> 40:10.630
The host bows in return!

40:12.920 --> 40:13.720
Young Master,

40:13.920 --> 40:15.230
the Liangjiang Viceroy's Office

40:15.230 --> 40:16.960
has sent people
to offer their condolences.

40:16.960 --> 40:19.090
Would you like to greet them in return?

40:22.630 --> 40:23.430
I'm not going.

40:23.920 --> 40:25.320
They invited my father.

40:26.070 --> 40:28.130
They didn't invite me to Liangjiang.

40:28.670 --> 40:30.920
The Sixth Prince's Mansion
sent the funeral gifts.

40:30.920 --> 40:32.710
I had the account office
issue the reward money,

40:32.710 --> 40:33.690
and in your name,

40:33.800 --> 40:35.130
wrote a thank-you note.

40:36.360 --> 40:37.400
Some of the old managers

40:37.400 --> 40:38.110
who have been working

40:38.110 --> 40:39.150
for the Old Master

40:39.280 --> 40:41.540
want to ask you a few questions in person.

40:41.630 --> 40:42.840
Do you have time to see them?

40:42.840 --> 40:43.630
I don't.

40:44.320 --> 40:45.190
If they want to ask questions,

40:45.190 --> 40:45.920
tell them to go ask the Old Master

40:45.920 --> 40:47.150
in the underworld.

40:47.960 --> 40:48.500
There's one more...

40:48.500 --> 40:49.560
Will this ever end?

41:01.670 --> 41:02.470
Young Master,

41:02.960 --> 41:03.760
today,

41:04.280 --> 41:05.810
you really can't yell at me.

41:06.440 --> 41:08.920
I've already
written my resignation letter.

41:08.920 --> 41:10.480
After the seven days of mourning,

41:10.480 --> 41:11.810
I'll retire and go home.

41:12.960 --> 41:14.490
This business is yours now.

41:14.710 --> 41:16.470
You can run it however you like.

41:17.070 --> 41:19.530
But the Old Master's spirit
hasn't left yet,

41:19.840 --> 41:21.970
and I can't ignore my responsibility.

41:24.360 --> 41:26.020
I worked for him my whole life,

41:26.670 --> 41:29.130
and I don't want to leave things
unfinished.

41:33.670 --> 41:34.730
The mother of Mr. Gu

41:35.280 --> 41:36.530
has passed away.

41:37.480 --> 41:38.070
Should we

41:38.110 --> 41:39.360
send some funeral gifts?

41:39.360 --> 41:41.020
The Old Master made mistakes—

41:42.230 --> 41:43.830
it's not my place to say that—

41:44.000 --> 41:44.480
but he did

41:44.480 --> 41:46.010
feel regret before he died.

41:46.440 --> 41:47.770
Sending something over

41:48.840 --> 41:50.440
would fulfill his last wish.

41:53.800 --> 41:55.260
You're quite thoughtful.

41:59.510 --> 42:00.480
So tell me,

42:02.360 --> 42:04.160
do you think my father was wrong?

42:08.030 --> 42:09.230
If he was wrong,

42:11.920 --> 42:12.800
that means he shouldn't have married

42:12.800 --> 42:13.880
into our Li family.

42:15.150 --> 42:16.190
And if he hadn't,

42:18.550 --> 42:20.030
I wouldn't have been born.

42:23.880 --> 42:25.150
What did I do wrong?

42:27.400 --> 42:28.190
Why do all of you

42:28.190 --> 42:29.230
hate me so much?

42:38.190 --> 42:39.990
Do you have anything else to say?

42:40.400 --> 42:41.730
The Salt Industry Guild

42:42.230 --> 42:44.110
asked you to go for the account review.

42:44.110 --> 42:45.040
Account review?

42:45.190 --> 42:45.990
What account?

42:46.880 --> 42:48.370
Back then you and Mr. Gu

42:48.760 --> 42:50.160
made a wager for 6 months.

42:50.670 --> 42:52.400
There's one month left.

42:52.710 --> 42:53.670
I told them you'd go

42:53.670 --> 42:55.800
after the seven-day mourning period.

42:59.360 --> 43:00.440
Is Gu Pingyuan ready

43:00.440 --> 43:01.630
to hand it over?
